 "sentences": [
  "In the town next door, hundreds of people sheltered by the sea, and none of them left.",
  "Herculaneum sat on the coast, west of Vesuvius.",
  "In the 1980s, archaeologists found around three hundred skeletons in stone boat sheds on the old shore.",
  "They were killed by a surge of scorching volcanic gas and ash.",
  "A 2001 study argued they died almost instantly from the heat.",
  "A 2020 study suggested some died more slowly, so the debate goes on.",
  "Follow for more from Pompeii."
